    "Emit spell_cast from SpellActionHandler on successful cast (include spellId from getSpellData).",
    "Emit spell_cast from spellbookWidgets executeTeleport with teleportName + spellbook (widget-keyed teleports).",
    "Jewelry enchant spells are NOT in spells.ts ENTRIES; likely widget-only \u2014 verify cache before import.",
    "Arceuus utility (Resurrect, Ward) and Lunar spells may be missing from ENTRIES \u2014 low confidence until verified.",
    "Region-qualified ice burst/barrage tasks need spell_cast + area_enter (or area predicate on cast tile).",
    "Phase 5 teleport_use covers non-spell travel (fairy ring, charter, spirit tree); city Teleport to X tasks are in teleport_spell group here."
  ]
